        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Until Death</strong> is a challenging 2D action game that tests your reflexes, focus, and endurance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone warrior trapped in endless waves of enemies — survive as long as you can. Every fight gets harder, every mistake costs you. With limited health, deadly foes, and only your skill to rely on, each run pushes you closer to mastering the art of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, responsive combat with melee and ranged enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups and shields to give you a fighting chance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemy behaviors that evolve each wave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score system that rewards skill and endurance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean pixel visuals with dynamic lighting and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack and minimal HUD for full immersion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive… or fall once more?<br><strong>Fight. Adapt. Endure. Until Death.</strong></p>",
